### ============================================================================
### Menu Order/Sort Update API Tests
### Base URL: http://129.204.59.156:30081
### API Prefix: /api/adm/menu/menus
###
### ✅ TEST RESULTS (2026-04-22):
### - API is reachable and returns HTTP 200
### - PUT /api/adm/menu/menus/{id} with orderNum update: ✅ SUCCESS
### - Tested menu ID 176:
###   * Updated orderNum from 0 → 10: SUCCESS (affected: 1 row)
###   * Updated orderNum from 10 → 25: SUCCESS (affected: 1 row)
###   * Restored orderNum from 25 → 0: SUCCESS (affected: 1 row)
### - GET /api/adm/menu/menus/{id}: ✅ Returns correct orderNum
### - GET /api/adm/menu/menus with orderBy & sort: ✅ SUCCESS
### - updateTime is automatically updated on orderNum change
### ============================================================================
@baseUrl = http://129.204.59.156:30081
@jwtToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@menuId = 1

### ============================================================================
### Setup: Get all menus to find valid menu IDs
### ============================================================================

###
### Get all menus (paginated list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&orderBy=order_num&sort=ASC

###
### Get all menus with JWT token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&orderBy=order_num&sort=ASC
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### ============================================================================
### Test 1: Update Menu Order Number (orderNum)
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-01-01: Update menu orderNum to 10
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNum": 10
}

###
### TC-01-02: Verify the orderNum was updated
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

###
### TC-01-03: Update menu orderNum to 5
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNum": 5
}

###
### TC-01-04: Query menus sorted by orderNum (ascending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&orderBy=order_num&sort=ASC

###
### TC-01-05: Query menus sorted by orderNum (descending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&orderBy=order_num&sort=DESC

### ============================================================================
### Test 2: Update Menu with Multiple Fields Including orderNum
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-02-01: Update menu with name and orderNum
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Menu Updated",
  "orderNum": 15
}

###
### TC-02-02: Verify the update
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

### ============================================================================
### Test 3: Query Menus with Different OrderBy Values
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-03-01: Query menus ordered by name (ASC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&orderBy=name&sort=ASC

###
### TC-03-02: Query menus ordered by name (DESC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&orderBy=name&sort=DESC

###
### TC-03-03: Query menus ordered by createTime (DESC - newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&orderBy=create_time&sort=DESC

###
### TC-03-04: Query menus ordered by updateTime (DESC - recently updated first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&orderBy=update_time&sort=DESC

### ============================================================================
### Test 4: Filter Menus by orderNum
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-04-01: Filter menus with specific orderNum
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&orderNum=10

###
### TC-04-02: Filter menus with orderNum=5
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&orderNum=5

### ============================================================================
### Test 5: Invalid Sort Value
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-05-01: Try invalid sort value (should return 400 error)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&orderBy=order_num&sort=INVALID

### ============================================================================
### Test 6: Default Sort Behavior (no sort parameter)
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-06-01: Query with orderBy but no sort (should default to ASC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&orderBy=order_num

###
### TC-06-02: Query with no orderBy or sort (should use default order_num ASC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20

### ============================================================================
### Test 7: Combined Filters with Sorting
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-07-01: Query menus filtered by menuType=C, sorted by orderNum
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&menuType=C&orderBy=order_num&sort=ASC

###
### TC-07-02: Query menus filtered by status=0, sorted by orderNum
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&status=0&orderBy=order_num&sort=ASC

###
### TC-07-03: Search menus with keyword "menu", sorted by orderNum
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=20&search=menu&orderBy=order_num&sort=ASC

### ============================================================================
### Cleanup: Restore Original Order
### ============================================================================

###
### Restore orderNum to 0 (default)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNum": 0
}
